  "worked_solution": "For the given vector $\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}2+4\\text{i} \\\\ 5-2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}]\\,$ we have that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =[\\begin{aligned}2+4\\text{i} \\\\ 5-2\\text{i}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{\\text{Re}(x)}+\\text{i}{{[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]}_{\u23df}}_{\\text{Im}(x)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore $\\,a=2,b=5,c=4$ and $d=-2$, which implies that \n\n$$\nad+bc=2\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot 4=16.\n$$",
